BOOT_ABS_ADDR	:Warning: Absolute address specifyed for Boot page will be ignored.
ERROR_5		:         Segment address will be boot page * 2K
ERROR_6		:Error: "%s", line %d: 
EXPCT_SYSTEM	:expecting 'SYSTEM' at symbol %s
REDEC		:trying to redeclare symbol %s
EXPCT_ID	:expecting an identifier at symbol %s
EXPCT_DOT	:expecting '.' at symbol %s
EXPCT_DIRECTIVE	:expecting directive at symbol %s
EXPCT_CONSTANT	:expecting a constant at symbol %s
EXPCT_SLASH	:expecting '/' at symbol %s
EXPCT_ABS	:expecting 'ABS' at symbol %s
SPEC_SEG_AREA	:you must specify memory segment area
SPEC_SEG_ADDRESS	:you must specify memory segment address
SPEC_SEG_TYPE	:you must specify memory segment type
DM_DATA_ONLY	:DM segment can have DATA attribute only
DM_EXCEED	:DM segment cannot exceed physical address h#3fff
DM_EXCEED_SEG	:DM segment cannot exceed physical address h#3fffff
EXPCT_SEG_MOD	:expecting segment modifier at symbol %s
EXPCT_RT_BRACKET	:expecting ']' at symbol %s
EXPCT_EQ	:expecting '=' at symbol %s
EXPCT_SEMICOLON	:expecting ';' at symbol %s
BOOT_LENGTH	:BOOT page exceeds max boot page size
BOOT_BOUNDARY	:BOOT page must be on a 2K word boundary
PORT_IN_BOOT	:ports are not allowed in boot memory
DM_INT_EXCEED	:no DM memory at addresses 0x3a00-0x3bff
DUP_MEM_SPACE	:only one memory space qualifier allowed per segment
DUP_MEM_TYPE	:only one memory type qualifier allowed per segment
ERR_OVLAP	:FATAL ERROR: over lap occurred
ERR_BOUND	:FATAL ERROR: boundary error occurred
ERR_INV2105	:FATAL ERROR: used invalid memory on ADSP2105 part
ERR_NOPM	:NOTICE:?no PM found
ERR_IMPPM	:FATAL ERROR:impossible PM configuration
ERR_PMDA1	:NOTICE:no code space in PM and PMDA pin MUST be used as MSB in PM address
ERR_PMDA2	:NOTICE:PMDA pin MUST be used as MSB in PM address
ERR_NOPMCD	:NOTICE:no code space in PM
ERR_PMDA3	:NOTICE:PMDA pin must be used as INVERTED MSB in PM address
ERR_PMDA4	:NOTICE:PMDA pin MUST NOT be used as MSB in PM address
ERR_SEMI	:Warning: Missing semicolon after ENDSYS directive
ERR_PAGE	:Error: Memory segment exceeds page size
INTERNAL_FIXED  :Error: Internal memory fixed on this part
